is father's final wish: the taking of Isa.\n\nThe only problem is that he had promised his beloved, Ahanas, that he would not become involved. Windaria is a war parable set in a fantasy land of unicorns and ghost ships.\n\n(Source: AnimeNfo)"},"tags":[{"name":"War","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":100,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Suicide","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Royal Affairs","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Exiled","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanks","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ghost","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":33,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Ships","rank":33,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aviation","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swimming","rank":26,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Once Upon A Time","english":"Once Upon A Time","native":"ウインダリア","romaji":"Windaria","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"渥大利亚"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Dungeon of Windaria"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Dôwa meita senshi Windaria"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}